0A\x0A- **Namespace Admin** - Full access to namespace configuration and data\x0A- **Namespace Write** - Execute workflows and modify workflow data\x0A- **Namespace Read** - Read-only access to namespace data\x0A\x0ANamespace-level permissions are scoped to specific namespaces. A user or service account may have different permission levels across different namespaces.\x0A\x0AFor detailed information about roles and permissions, see [Access Control Documentation](https://docs.temporal.io/cloud/users).2\x031.0:\xA7\x01\x0A\x06x-logo\x12\x9C\x01*\x99\x01\x0A\x96\x01\x0A\x03url\x12\x8E\x01\x1A\x8B\x01https://images.ctfassets.net/0uuz8ydxyd9p/4YGUnEoCaH9SyoUDhlJkau/e1600205d17eeee3033d926ef06664a9/Temporal_LogoLockup_Horizontal_dark_1.svgj.\x0A\x0ANamespaces\x12 Manage Temporal Cloud namespacesj0\x0A\x05Users\x12'Manage users and their namespace accessjF\x0A\x10Service Accounts\x122Manage service accounts and their namespace accessj.\x0A\x08API Keys\x12\"Manage API keys for authenticationj1\x0A\x06Groups\x12'Manage user groups and group membershipj\x1F\x0A\x05Nexus\x12\x16Manage Nexus endpointsj\x7F\x0A\x11High Availability\x12jManage high availability (multi-region, multi-cloud, and same-region replication) namespace configurationsj7\x0A\x06Export\x12-Manage workflow history export configurationsj7\x0A\x12Connectivity Rules\x12!Manage network connectivity rulesj\"\x0A\x07Regions\x12\x17Query available regionsj,\x0A\x07Account\x12!Manage account settings and usagej9\x0A\x0CCustom Roles\x12)Manage custom roles and their permissionsj\xB4\x01\x0A\x08Projects\x12\xA7\x01Manage projects and project-level access control. Projects are an upcoming feature and may not be enabled for your account. Contact Temporal support to request access.j*\x0A\x0AOperations\x12\x1CQuery async operation statusr>\x0A\x1CTemporal Cloud Documentation\x12\x1Ehttps://docs.temporal.io/cloudb\x06proto3"
